OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle late night
OL,4,Ablaze after lorry bursts into flames
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters tackled a late night fire
OL,7,Fin Glasgow after a tarmacking lorry
OL,8,Fnear the M8  motorway burst into
OL,9,Fflames.
OL,11,FThe incident occurred on New City Road,
OL,12,Fnear Phoenix Road, just after 23:20 on
OL,13,FTuesday night.
OL,15,FSocial media posts described hearing "a
OL,16,Fvery loud bang/explosion" near the city
OL,17,Fcentre, followed by huge plumes of
OL,18,Fsmoke, while videos showed fire crews
OL,19,Fextinguishing the vehicle with water.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
