OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle late night
OL,4,Ablaze after lorry bursts into flames
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,Fsaid it sent three appliances to the
OL,8,Fscene, and departed about 01:30 after
OL,9,Fmaking the area safe.
